          "question": "Her options today",
          "icon": "../assets/icons/timer-ink.png",
          "role": "slate",
          "text": "Wait about **three days** for an analyst, or **weeks** for a curated tool to be set up.",
          "action": "Or learn the schema and SQL herself."
        },
